 "remarks": "Lovely spacious 2 Br 2 1/2 Bath Townhouse in the Kingswood Condos in the Cranberry area. Convenient To Train, Rt 7 And Shopping. Loads Of Storage & 1 Car Garage. Main level features elegant Living room W/Crown Molding, Wood Burning Fireplace and Dining Area. The kitchen has a breakfast nook and sliders to access the deck. The third level is where you will find the primary suite, complete with full bath and walk-in California closet, second bedroom, and a recently updated second full bath. Also on this floor is a small bonus room perfect for an office. The lower level is has access to the garage along with a room with sliders, and the washer and dryer. Newer Heating & A/C. Credit check, references, 2 months security. Great commuter location close to highways and train. Ask about pets.",
